#: b91832af51d5422f948a01fc3f9c6d2c d93c23f3c7e346428b46a245619c156f
msgid ""
":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>`: the autopilot designated GPIO pin to be used "
"for the function. See  the :ref:`common-gpios` page for information on how "
"to determine the pin numbers and setup for using autopilot servo/motor "
"outputs. DroneCAN peripherals with remote relay outputs have pin numbers in "
"the 1000 to 1015 range. Consult the peripheral's documentation for proper "
"pin number to use."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>`：飞控指定用于该功能的 GPIO "
"引脚。有关如何确定引脚编号及使用飞控舵机/电机输出的设置方法，请参阅 :ref:`common-gpios` 页面。带有远程继电器输出的 "
"DroneCAN 外设，其引脚编号范围为1000至1015。请查阅外设文档以确定正确的引脚编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:39 3f75f73177764aecb28d9ca243b93281
#: 703aada3432944f3a149b06c0f56b613 cde29de18f5b4c7ab703480a68eb872f
#: d00af18e5aa1429c99eb93238953a6c5 f33d7dbcad1f4231ab92bcaf2f5a9fa6
msgid ""
":ref:`RELAY2_DEFAULT<RELAY2_DEFAULT>`: After boot up, should the relay "
"default to ON (1) or OFF (0, default), or 2 = no change from bootloader "
"state for the relay output pin. This only applies to RELAYx_FUNC \"Relay\" "
"(1). All other uses will pick the appropriate default output state from "
"within the controlling function's parameters."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RELAY2_DEFAULT<RELAY2_DEFAULT>`：启动后，继电器默认设为 ON（1）还是 OFF（0，默认），或2 = "
"保持引导程序状态不变。此参数仅适用于 RELAYx_FUNC 为「Relay」（1）的情况。所有其他用途将从各自控制功能的参数中选择合适的默认输出状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:40 3ca1270cb8b0414bbb4037f28a6706c7
#: 658d5de8e15749b6a24348f12e8192f5 6b87b5b1d3f345bc820a4e9a7f5b0968
#: 80f794b6e9b94504b01d71e095c346a2 99eb9ef64e9b4fcbbf97967bf6c14b49
msgid ""
":ref:`RELAY2_INVERTED<RELAY2_INVERTED>`: this parameter controls the actual "
"output voltage level corresponding to the \"ON\"  state. If set to \"1\", "
"the ON will actually be a low output, versus the normal high output voltage "
"level. Will also impact the :ref:`RELAY2_DEFAULT<RELAY2_DEFAULT>` output "
"voltage level."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RELAY2_INVERTED<RELAY2_INVERTED>`：此参数控制对应「ON」状态的实际输出电压电平。若设为「1」，ON "
"状态实际输出低电平，而非正常的高电平。这也会影响 :ref:`RELAY2_DEFAULT<RELAY2_DEFAULT>` 的输出电压电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-relay.rst:42 0585a9fb2e584e9796f1d20ad741223d
